  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Accountable Grant with Chatham House for Low Carbon Study -Understanding the energy needs of displaced people in developing countries is a component of Low Carbon Studies - research projects to support the development of the International Climate Fund reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;66,217. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Energy research, Environmental policy and administrative management, Energy generation, renewable sources - multiple technologies.</narrative>
